  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender-inclusive early recovery of RoL institutions through the empowerment of women justice  professionals (KOICA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To enable women in authorities to provide more accessible public services to women in communities, including GBV survivors, the project will build individual capacity of women rule of law professionals, such as women paralegals, lawyers, police officers, prosecutors, judges, prison officers, and protection service providers (social workers).</narrative>
  </description>
